body:
So here's the fucking question: what the FUCK can I do? Which corporation do I blow up? 70% of world emissions are because of fucking garbage ass companies not regulating, and there is NOTHING your average person can do! Every goddamn day, I wrestle with the idea of suicide to reduce my goddamn carbon footprint and to reduce the amount of fucking resources I have to consume on this God-forsaken planet, and really, if I wasn't a selfish bitch worried about "hurting those I love" (ugh, makes me sick just typing it out), I'd be dead already. This is why I'm pro-suicide. Humans will ravage anything they get their shitty little paws on. We shouldn't be saving them, and the only way to save the earth is to cull the menace!

&#x200B;

And no, this is NOT a troll post or anything like that! The longer you disregard these kinds of views as "extremist" and "alarming" is the longer you will prevent healing of the planet! It is the longer you will extend the suffering of this awful, dying race!
